        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "We went there on a Saturday afternoon at 3pm, not busy; good and fast service. Loved their specials with tomato soup, main meal, dessert and drink. We ordered veal and spaghetti, as well as pizaghetti, both were delicious! Loved their spaghetti meat sauce and rice pudding dessert.",
        "time": 1557456639,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Larry Mancini",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109735680426049858577/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI25YQuLi8f5I8VY7ajXNMOW3C1DpcHzvqzz7uQDwHpgFkqsA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "If your resto is called pizza 4 seasons you should offer the traditional 4 seasons. Its ingredients are standard and can be found on Wikipedia",
        "time": 1768693506,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Leila Sauro",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101819647996472530681/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJhzK0Mg03J2z_ZFfkwIfjXXz-lAteLjVBals51k5w-iozARA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "The food was exquisite I was in heaven. This restaurant is a staple of vaudreuil. A true hidden gem. The service was fantastic very attentive and kind. I ordered the le steak submarine and the steak was cooked to perfection. The food was so good I ordered more to bring home. The place was so fresh and relaxing the staff made me feel at home. The waitress had informed me that the\nrestaurant has new owners and there is a new upgraded menu coming out and I can’t wait to keep coming back!",
        "time": 1751441913,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Menard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100342572671409591073/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRqjQQDmqZh0ZXFELemMQskjQVJ-uI8qE3cI2_-sL3EBbMGx8d=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Food has always been excellent, service is fantastic and it's the best pizza in the area!",
        "time": 1758537127,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Daniel Gontar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111120779047341520369/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVtC7ImTRNpxUBusDhUoZzxlti87KJDFvC59NA19PZFhoJVusI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Best pizza anywhere! Not anymore! Been getting pizza there for years, has always been good and consistent. But for the past year it’s been either a hit or a miss either way mostly misses. Today was my last time that I will get pizza from three as it was almost not edible, burnt, hard crust with a cardboard taste.\nToo bad used to be so good.",
        "time": 1735964883,
        "translated": false
      }
